      "heading_context": "## Decision Cheat Sheet",
      "headers": [
        "Question",
        "Answer"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "Why sulfide in kraft?",
          "Accelerates lignin removal, prevents condensation"
        ],
        [
          "What is kappa number?",
          "Measure of residual lignin (1 kappa ≈ 0.15% lignin)"
        ],
        [
          "What is the recovery boiler's dual role?",
          "Burn organic for energy + reduce Na2SO4 → Na2S"
        ],
        [
          "Why not use chlorine for bleaching today?",
          "AOX (dioxin risk), ECF (ClO2) achieves same brightness"
        ],
        [
          "Why is kraft yield only ~50%?",
          "Lignin + some hemicellulose dissolved in cooking"
        ],
        [
          "What is causticizing?",
          "Na2CO3 + Ca(OH)2 → regenerate NaOH for white liquor"
        ],
        [
          "How does the mill achieve energy self-sufficiency?",
          "Recovery boiler burns black liquor organics"
        ]
      ]
    }
  ]
